@title Fundraiser Variety Night: Running Order
@subtitle 16 acts, curtain 19:30, hard stop 21:45
@date Working draft
@width wide

!!! All 16 acts cannot fit. With every changeover counted and one 20-minute interval, the show ends at 22:17, which is 32 minutes after the 21:45 limit. At least about 30 minutes of acts and changeovers have to go, or the limit has to move. Every other rule is met in the order below.

kpi Projected finish | 22:17 | 32 min over the 21:45 limit | bad
kpi Act time | 111 min | 16 acts
kpi Changeovers | 36 min | 43 min in the column, minus 7 min absorbed by the interval
kpi Interval | 20 min | after slot 6, 20:35 to 20:55

